es/icons/devices/rugged/rugged-mobile-phone-exchange.svg"></svg></div><div class="text"><p class="sub-heading"></p><h3 class="heading"><span>Mobile Application Management</span></h3><div class="description"></div></div><div class="cta"><span>Learn More</span></div></div></a></div><div class="callout col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 col-xl-3"><a href="https://www.ivanti.com/products/incapptic-connect"><div class="content"><div class="plain-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="graphics-symbol" aria-hidden="true" data-src="https://static.ivanti.com/sites/marketing/media/images/icons/devices/smartphone-tablet-refresh.svg"></svg></div><div class="text"><p class="sub-heading"></p><h3 class="heading"><span>Automated App Release</span></h3><div class="description"></div></div><div class="cta"><span>Learn More</span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="cb67bf6e" class="AHCLayoutTextImage"><div class="section-class-container"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="content col-xs-12 col-md-6"><div class="text"><p class="eyebrow-title"><span>Still your partner after the sale</span></p><h2 id="default"><span>We don’t trumpet our technology only to fall silent on support</span></h2><h2 id="fresh"></h2><div><p>Our technical representatives stand ready to help you keep your end-users productive and deliver information that provides easy-to-find answers to common questions.</p>

